<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Suche – Flauschiversum</title>
<meta name="description" content="Suche in den Anleitungen und Ideen des Flauschiversums.">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://flauschiversum.de/suche/">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css?v=HASH">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/pagefind/pagefind-ui.css">
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" type="image/vnd.microsoft.icon">
<link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="Flauschiversum" href="https://flauschiversum.de/rss.xml">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="Flauschiversum">
<meta property="og:locale" content="de_DE">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:title" content="Suche">
<meta property="og:description" content="Suche in den Anleitungen und Ideen des Flauschiversums.">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://flauschiversum.de/suche/">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
</head>
<body>
<div class="container-fluid">
<header id="blogheader">
  <div class="logo">
    <p class="site-title"><a href="/">Flauschiversum</a></p>
    <p class="description">Mehr als nur eine Masche <small>neue Posts an Sonntagen</small></p>
  </div>
  <nav class="center">
    <a href="/">Start</a>
    <a href="/themen/">Themen</a>
    <a href="/beitraege/">Beiträge</a>
    <a href="/tipps-und-tricks/">Tipps und Tricks</a>
    <a href="/about/">About</a>
    <a href="/impressum/">Impressum</a>
    <a href="/rss.xml">Abonnieren</a>
  </nav>
  
</header>

<main class="topic search-page">
  <header class="topic-head">
    <h1>Suche</h1>
  </header>
  <form class="search big" id="search-form" action="/suche/" method="get" role="search">
    <label for="q">Was möchtest du machen?</label>
    <div class="search-row">
      <input type="search" id="q" name="q" placeholder="z.B. Mütze, Katze, Filz …" autocomplete="off">
      <button type="submit">Suchen</button>
    </div>
  </form>
  <div id="search" hidden></div>
  <noscript>
    <p class="notice">Die Suche braucht JavaScript. Ohne kannst du stöbern: in den <a href="/themen/">Themen</a> oder in <a href="/beitraege/">allen Beiträgen</a>.</p>
  </noscript>
  <p class="browse">Lieber stöbern? <a href="/themen/">Themen</a> &middot; <a href="/beitraege/">Alle Beiträge</a></p>
</main>

<footer class="center">
  <p>&copy; 2026 Ermeline Wollknoll &mdash;&nbsp;<a href="/impressum/">Impressum</a></p>
</footer>
</div>

<script src="/pagefind/pagefind-ui.js"></script>
<script type="module" src="/assets/js/search.js?v=HASH"></script>

</body>
</html>
